  "id": "participative-management",
  "term": "participative management",
  "definition": "Participative management is a management approach in which members of an organization are encouraged to take part in its management and decision-making. In the source material, it is treated as one dimension of high-performance human resource practices and is linked indirectly to lower turnover intention through stronger organizational commitment.",
